Tent - General: {{Infobox location

}}

The Tent is home to Linus, who spends much of his day in and around the tent. It's located on the Mountain northeast of the Carpenter's Shop and east of the passage to the Railroad. It can be entered without first gaining any friendship points.

The Mines-- General - {{Infobox location

}}

The Mines are located in the north area of letter from Morris stating that the landslide blocking the entrance to the mine has been removed.

The Summit-- Cutscene - layer did not use any Joja services (i.e. they restored the Golden Joja Parrot, and did not purchase any Perfection Waivers), the end of the credits will say "No Joja services used!" with an animation of Morris flying.

The cutscene ends with the player's Grandpa and Mr. Qi congratulating the player on their accomplishment.
