Catalogue - General: {{Infobox furniture

}}
The Catalogue is a piece of Furniture that can be purchased from Pierre's General Store for .

Once placed, in the catalogue allows the player to purchase many wallpaper and flooring items for in unlimited quantity. The Catalogue does not include certain special wallpapers like the Mystery Wallpaper or those exclusive to other catalogues.

The catalogue is similar to the Furniture Catalogue sold at the Carpenter's Shop, which gives access to Furniture items.

Tip: + on an item in the Catalogue or Furniture Catalogue will add it directly to inventory, instead of attaching it to the mouse cursor.

Golden Chicken - General: {{Infobox animal

}}
The Golden Chicken is an animal that lives in a Big Coop. Golden Chickens can be hatched by placing a Coopmaster Profession.

Egg - General: {{Infobox

}}
The Egg and the Brown Egg are animal products obtained from White, Brown, or Blue shop at the Desert Festival for Calico Egg.

Eggs can be hatched in an incubator, which comes with a Big or Deluxe Coop.

Large Egg - General: {{Infobox

}}
The Large Egg and the Large Brown Egg are animal products obtained from friendship. Large Eggs produce Quality Mayonnaise when used with a Mayonnaise Machine.

Large Eggs can be hatched in an incubator, which comes with a Big or Deluxe Coop.

Aquatic Sanctuary - General: {{Infobox furniture

}}
The Aquatic Sanctuary is a 7 tile wide piece of furniture that can be purchased for from Qi's Walnut Room.

Deluxe Fish Tank - General: {{Infobox furniture

